      <p class="fig">Figure 5 · Planning model, October 2026. Cream is the same in every column because it comes off the clarifier. The right-hand column is what the membranes could yield. It is not the plan. AgriInnovate, the interest-free loan in that row, is closed.<sup><a href="#note-6">6</a></sup></p>
      <p>A planning model, not a term sheet. At ${MODEL.downsidePricePerKg.toFixed(2)} a kilogram the same plant still clears about {millions(c.downside.ebitda)} EBITDA. The {Math.round(MODEL.grantShare * 100)}% grant is not in hand. Cream alone covers drying, freight, and power.</p>
      <section class="panel" id="run" aria-labelledby="run-h">
